# AGENTS.md marks the shadcn primitives themselves edit-forbidden (stories are
# not). `npm run format` had been failing outright since the monorepo move, so
# nothing enforced that; now that it runs again it would rewrite all of them.
# Written as a file glob, not a directory. Prettier uses gitignore semantics,
# where a negation cannot re-include anything under an excluded DIRECTORY —
# `ui/` followed by `!ui/*.stories.tsx` silently protects the stories too.
packages/shadcn-kit/components/ui/*.tsx
!packages/shadcn-kit/components/ui/*.stories.tsx